  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">baked brie arrives from the oven wrapped in golden, flaky pastry, its creamy center ready to spill onto your plate. Dip crisp apple slices into the warm cheese that flows like honey, while toasted walnuts and a drizzle of maple syrup add aroma and crunch. This bright, family-friendly take skips wine and leans on fresh orange juice and a touch of thyme for lift. Perfect for cozy nights or impromptu gatherings, baked brie turns simple moments into memorable feasts, inviting smiles and satisfied sighs with every gooey bite.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-baked-brie\">Why You’ll Love This Baked Brie</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-baked-brie\">How to Make Baked Brie</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-baked-brie\">Pro Tips for Making Baked Brie</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-baked-brie\">How to Serve this Baked Brie</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-baked-brie\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Baked Brie</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It&#8217;s a crowd-pleaser that impresses every time.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfect for any occasion, from cozy nights to festive gatherings.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to make with just a few simple ingredients.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customizable with your favorite toppings, like honey or nuts.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Warm, gooey cheese that melts in your mouth!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-5850\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"5850\" data-servings=\"8\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow